    <string name="whats_new_title">What\'s new in 1.0</string>
    <string name="whats_new_text">• Checklist based on the government\'s 72-hour advice\n• Expiry reminders\n• Emergency plan as PDF\n• Widget for your home screen</string>
    <string name="onb_title_1">Ready for 72 hours</string>
    <string name="onb_text_1">If the power, water or internet fails, you need to manage on your own for the first three days. Noodkoffer helps you build and maintain your emergency kit.</string>
    <string name="onb_title_2">Who is in your household?</string>
    <string name="onb_text_2">The app calculates how much water, food and cash you need.</string>
    <string name="onb_title_3">Never miss an expiry date</string>
    <string name="onb_text_3">Get a reminder 30 and 7 days before water, batteries or medicines expire, and at your half-yearly check.</string>
